{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/coding-theory-error-correction/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-coding-theory","title":"为何需要编码理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/coding-theory-error-correction/foundations/why-coding-theory","wordCount":1725,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"channel-noise-model","title":"信道与噪声模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/coding-theory-error-correction/foundations/channel-noise-model","wordCount":1686,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"hamming-distance","title":"汉明距离与界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/coding-theory-error-correction/foundations/hamming-distance","wordCount":1567,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"基础\">基础</h1><p>在能构造任何一个具体的码之前，必须先回答三个更本质的问题：冗余凭什么能把错误纠正回来、噪声该怎样被精确地描述、以及一个码到底「好」在哪里。这一章就是为整个 hub 铺设这三块地基。</p>\n<p>第一篇从最朴素的直觉出发，说明为什么简单的重复不是好办法，冗余若安排得当能同时做到检测与纠正，并区分「检错」与「纠错」这两个常被混淆的能力。它也点明本 hub 与信息论的分界：香农告诉我们极限在哪，编码理论负责逼近。</p>\n<p>第二篇把「噪声」从模糊的日常词汇变成可计算的概率对象。二元对称信道、二元擦除信道、加性高斯白噪声信道各自刻画一类真实场景，而信噪比与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_b/N_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 则是后续所有性能曲线的横轴。硬判决与软判决的区别在这里首次出现，它将决定后面 LDPC 与极化码能发挥多大威力。</p>\n<p>第三篇给出贯穿全 hub 的核心度量——汉明距离。一个码的最小距离直接决定它能检出几个错、纠正几个错；而 Singleton、Hamming、Gilbert-Varshamov、Plotkin 等界则划出了「码率」与「纠错力」之间不可兼得的边疆。后面每遇到一个新码，我们都会回来问：它的最小距离是多少、它离哪条界最近。</p>\n<p>这三篇按「动机 → 模型 → 度量」的顺序递进，是阅读线性码及之后所有章节的前提，建议顺序读完。</p>\n"}